<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">C. Caraffa</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
andere Theile &#x017F;ind offenbar fremdes Gut. Von Ko&#x0364;nig Jacob <hi rendition="#aq">I.</hi> von<lb/>
